(18004352, 'Shaw Hart', 'USA Today and Amazon Top 100 Bestselling Author Shaw Hart writes short, sweet, and steamy romances. Looking for some flirty, feel good reads? Then check out her books on Amazon! Website: www.shawhart.comNewsletter: www.subscribepage.com/shawhartFacebook:www.facebook.com/shawhartbooksInstagram:www.instagram.com/authorshawhartVIP Group: www.facebook.com/groups/645983902537855/Pinterest: pin.it/6Au9vEDBookbub: www.bookbub.com/profile/shaw-hartEmail: contact@shawhart.com', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1726942856p5/18004352.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/shawhartbooks/', 'https://www.instagram.com/authorshawhart/', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZUH9EAEE4m0', 'https://shawhart.com/', 1),
(18005649, 'Amanda Montell', 'Amanda Montell is a writer, linguist, and podcast host living in Los Angeles. She is the author of three nonfiction books, Cultish: The Language of Fanaticism, Wordslut: A Feminist Guide to Taking Back the English Language, and The Age of Magical Overthinking: Notes on Modern Irrationality (forthcoming April 9, 2024 from OneSignal). She is also a creator and host of the hit podcast, Sounds Like A Cult. Amanda’s books have earned praise from The Washington Post, The Atlantic, Kirkus Reviews, and more. Cultish was named a best book of 2021 by NPR, was shortlisted for several prizes including the Goodreads Choice Awards and getAbstract International Book Award, and is currently in development for television. Sounds Like A Cult won “Best Emergi', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1701118153p5/18005649.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/amandamontellauthor/', 'https://www.instagram.com/amanda_montell/?hl=en', 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmBvRbI_2XS4vEu8XZbSEtA', 'https://amandamontell.com/', 1),
