(18142813, 'Kathryn  Moon', 'Kathryn Moon is a country mouse who started dictating stories to her mother at an early age. The fascination with building new worlds and discovering the lives of the characters who grew in her head never faltered, and she graduated college with a fiction writing degree. She loves writing women were are strong in their vulnerability, romances that are as affectionate as they are challenging, and worlds that a reader sinks into and never wants to leave. When her hands aren\'t busy typing they\'re probably knitting sweaters or crimping pie crust in Ohio. She definitely believes in magic.You can reach her on Facebook and at ohkathrynmoon@gmail.com', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1587992957p5/18142813.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/ohkathrynmoon/', 'https://www.instagram.com/ohkathrynmoon/?hl=en', 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKYwep4GnaeK1-dHtbcd4Bg', 'https://www.kathrynmoon.com/', 1),
