(18207326, 'Macy Blake', 'Macy Blake believes in unicorns and fairies, in moonbeams and stardust, and that happily ever after comes in all colors of the rainbow. When she’s not busy at the day job, she loses herself in paranormal romance, living vicariously through her favorite sexy fictional heroes. These days you can often find her pounding away at the keyboard, trying to capture the magic of her own worlds.', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1562650034p5/18207326.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/MacyBlakeAuthor/', 'https://www.instagram.com/authormacyblake/', 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7kPapXi6xZdinjSoxeqhRA', 'https://macyblake.com/', 1),
(18210189, 'C. Hallman', 'C. Hallman is a USA Today Bestselling Author who wrote her debut novel in 2018 and has since published over 100 books in various romance subgenres. Her works have been on numerous bestseller lists and have been translated into 8 languages around the world.When she doesn\'t write her next novel, she publishes spicy novellas under the pen name Darcy Rose. FOLLOW ME ON SOCIAL MEDIA>>>>https://www.facebook.com/Cassandrahal...https://www.instagram.com/challman_wr...https://www.bookbub.com/profile/cassa...', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1668616024p5/18210189.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/CassandraHallman/', 'https://www.instagram.com/challman_writes/', 'https://www.youtube.com/@HallmarkChannelUSA', 'https://www.authorchallman.com/', 1),
(18246442, 'Ramy Vance', 'Ramy is the creator of the GoneGod World - a universe dedicated to myth, magic, mischief and mayhem.He lives in Edinburgh with his wife, demonic toddler, monstrous 8-year old and imaginary dog. Terrified, he pretty much stays in his office and writes.', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1611172866p5/18246442.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/gonegodworld/', 'https://www.instagram.com/ramy.vance/', 'https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/ramyvance', 'https://ramy-vance.com/pages/reading-order-1', 1),
