(18374765, 'Nicola  Jane', 'Nicola Jane is a romance author. She writes Motorcycle romance with badass alpha\'s and (sometimes) feisty females. She loves to write and read books of a similar genre to what she writes. Nicola Jane lives in Nottinghamshire, England with her husband, two children and four dogs.', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1653036894p5/18374765.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/nicolajane.ltd/', 'https://www.instagram.com/nicola.jane/', 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4Ybp1X8w86jQiQNfIu8OEQ', 'https://www.nicolajane.com/view-all-clothing-/', 1),
