(18422461, 'A.J. Lancaster', 'AJ Lancaster lives in New Zealand and writes romantic, whimsical fantasy in a house containing two ridiculous cats and many plants.https://www.instagram.com/a.j.lancaster/https://www.facebook.com/lancasterwri...https://twitter.com/lancasterwrites', 'https://images.gr-assets.com/authors/1685436065p5/18422461.jpg', 'https://www.facebook.com/aj.lancaster.334/', 'https://www.instagram.com/a.j.lancaster/', 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtYXAqhpdyVtxq4jQpr9k7w', 'https://ajlancaster.com/', 1),
